@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Export Tasks to CSV (Implementation)
hide footbox
actor User
participant UI
participant CsvExporter
participant Tasks


User -> UI : exportCSV(filePath)
UI -> CsvExporter : exportToCsv(filePath)

CsvExporter -> Tasks : getAllTasks()
Tasks --> CsvExporter : taskList

loop for each Task
    CsvExporter -> CsvExporter : extract fields (title, description, subtasks, etc.)
    CsvExporter -> CsvExporter : format CSV line
    CsvExporter -> CsvExporter : write line to file
end

CsvExporter --> UI : exportSuccess
UI --> User : confirmation

@enduml
